flowchart TD
    U[User browser] --> SWA[Azure Static Web Apps]
    U --> FB[Firebase Authentication - Google]
    SWA -->|HTTPS / Bearer token| API[Azure Functions HTTP API]
    API --> AUTH[Verify Firebase ID token<br/>Google Secure Token JWKS]
    API --> DB[(Azure Cosmos DB)]
    API --> BLOB[(Private Azure Blob Storage)]
    API --> KV[Azure Key Vault]
    API --> AI[Application Insights]
    AI --> LAW[Log Analytics]
    LAW --> ALERT[Azure Monitor 5xx alert]
    ALERT --> AG[Action Group email]
    GH[GitHub repository - main] --> GA[GitHub Actions]
    GA --> SWA
